==============================================================================================
PAIRED DIFFERENCE, 1 kHz minus 1 Hz, taken within each replicate
==============================================================================================
   zero sampling:  +0.80, +0.72, +0.71   =>  mean +0.74  sd 0.04
          1/1024:  +45.20, +44.82, +45.00   =>  mean +45.01  sd 0.15

  This round's own noise floor (largest within-cell sd): 0.20 points
  Pre-registered noise floor (from 09-01):                0.70 points

==============================================================================================
THE FOUR PRE-REGISTERED PREDICTIONS  (PREREG.md 3, frozen before any cell existed)
==============================================================================================
  P1  zero sampling: the two arms differ by <= the noise floor
      measured +0.74, bar 0.70  =>  DOES NOT HOLD
      HOLDS   => the step is triggered by whether samples exist; the interval
                 does not matter when the flow table is empty (PREREG 2).
      FAILS   => the mechanism is wrong: 1 kHz is expensive with nothing to walk.

  P2  1/1024: the 1 kHz arm is materially above the 1 Hz arm
      measured +45.01, bar 0.70  =>  HOLDS

  P3  that difference is about 46 points
      measured +45.01 vs 46  =>  98% of the 09-01 cross-round difference
      => the 09-01 attribution HOLDS: that difference is this constant.

  P4  the 1 Hz arm has no step: zero -> 1/1024 costs only a few points
      measured +1.21 points
      the 1 kHz arm's own step, for contrast: +45.48 points

==============================================================================================
CONTROLS -- what must NOT move between the arms
==============================================================================================
  iperf3 does identical work in every cell and is the noise reference. bmv2 and the
  proxy are separate processes; the constant under test is inside the kernel only.
  If these move with the arm, something other than the kernel changed.

       condition    process      1 Hz     1 kHz     delta
   zero sampling      iperf    114.0%    113.6%      -0.4
   zero sampling       bmv2    151.0%    144.8%      -6.2
   zero sampling      proxy      4.3%      4.3%      -0.0
   zero sampling    machine     24.6%     16.1%      -8.5
          1/1024      iperf    113.7%    122.3%      +8.6
          1/1024       bmv2    151.6%    146.8%      -4.8
          1/1024      proxy      7.3%      7.1%      -0.2
          1/1024    machine     20.4%     17.9%      -2.5

==============================================================================================
WHAT THIS IS STILL NOT
==============================================================================================
  The pair is at commit 4d831b58 (2026-08-31), NOT today's HEAD: it does not carry
  the 09-01 B-2(1) and E-2 fixes. Only the nopoll arm was run, so E-2's path is not
  exercised, but 'these numbers are today's HEAD' is not a claim this round makes.
  Absolute heights are not comparable to the 09-01 round -- that round measured a
  third binary. Only the within-round arm difference is attributable.
